  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Round 1 Details**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the Round 1 screenshots with a critical eye, focusing specifically on the desktop hero image. I\'ve pinpointed a crucial defect: the hero portrait\'s blending appears off, and the SVG fallback shows overlap. I\'m scrutinizing the details in `r1-desktop-hero.png` and `r1-mobile-hero.png` to understand the root cause. This requires a sharp eye.\n\n\n**Refining Mobile Hero Design**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the mobile hero image, noticing that the studio light is still visible. The mix-blend-mode is causing the dark SVG fallback to show through the founder\'s neck. I propose tweaking the visual telemetry text, replacing the double-slash comments, removing the silhouette, and cropping the image to hide the unwanted light. My focus is centered on addressing the overlap and enhancing the visual integrity.\n\n\n**Addressing Manifesto Line Count**\n\nI\'ve just focused on the Manifesto section, analyzing `r1-desktop-manifesto.png`. I\'ve fixed the line distribution, ensuring the manifesto statement now spans the intended five lines by adjusting `max-width` and `font-size`. I\'ve also widened the scroll range and fine-tuned the scroll reveal trigger to make the soft transition edge more distinct. The composition is now cleaner and more balanced.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
