  planner_response {
    response: "I have built and verified the single-file company profile landing page for **REKAVANTA \342\200\224 Technology & Product Studio** in `/index.html`.\n\n### Summary of Implementation & Verification\n\n- **Section 01 \342\200\224 Hero / Company Introduction (`#home`)**:\n  - Built on the `#DADADA` / `#CDCDCD` / `#111111` monochromatic palette with a `u = min(100vw / 1440, 1.333px)` proportional scale and `938u` target desktop height.\n  - Features the upper-left sliding active-pill navigation (`Home`, `Studio`, `Work`), upper-right `Contact \342\206\227` trigger, clipped mask-reveal `Archivo` headline (`\"BUILD WHAT\'S NEXT.\"`), supporting copy, and the two business cards (`02+ Business Directions` and `03 Selected Initiatives`).\n  - Integrates an original monochromatic editorial portrait of a technology architect seen from behind with the embedded `REKAVANTA` / `TECHNOLOGY & PRODUCT STUDIO` brand identity plate, the right-hand `(ABOUT REKAVANTA)` column with `Explore Our Studio \342\206\227` and `Start a Conversation \342\206\227` CTAs, and the bottom conceptual domain bar (`SOFTWARE`, `PRODUCTS`, `INTELLIGENCE`).\n- **Section 02 \342\200\224 Manifesto / Company Philosophy (`#manifesto`)**:\n  - Full-width `#000000` canvas featuring the 24-word brand statement distributed across five centered lines, with each word wrapped in its own `.manifesto-word` span.\n  - Implements a scroll-driven reading-order color reveal from `#6F6F6F` to `#F4F4F4` with a 3-word soft transition edge (plus `?rec=1` time-based progression support), accompanied by the supporting statement and the `ENGINEERING`, `INNOVATION`, and `IMPACT` labels.\n- **Section 03 \342\200\224 Our Studio / Business Model & Selected Work (`#studio` & `#work`)**:\n  - Bordered editorial panel (`rgba(255,255,255,0.14)`) presenting `\"Two engines. One direction.\"` and the two distinct pillars (`PILLAR 01 \342\200\224 DIGITAL SERVICES` and `PILLAR 02 \342\200\224 DIGITAL PRODUCTS`).\n  - Showcases the three Selected Initiatives (`01 \342\200\224 HUNI` [PRODUCT CONCEPT], `02 \342\200\224 PERSONAL OS` [PRODUCT CONCEPT], and `03 \342\200\224 SENTUL TREKKING INFORMATION SYSTEM` [COMMUNITY PROJECT]) with category filters and interactive initiative brief modals, followed by the final call to action (`\"Have an idea worth building?\"` / `\"Let\'s Build Together \342\206\227\"`), a validated inquiry dialog, and a minimal footer.\n- **Verification**:\n  - **Unit Tests**: Verified word-by-word scroll interpolation math (soft 3-word transition edge) and inquiry form validation via `node:test`.\n  - **Browser & Responsive Checks**: Verified across `1440x900` desktop and `390x844` mobile viewports with zero console errors and zero horizontal overflow (`scrollWidth === innerWidth`)."
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visual Impact**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the visual impact of the Round 2 captures. In `r2-desktop-hero.png`, the powerful editorial lines \"BUILD\" and \"WHAT\'S NEXT.\" immediately stand out on the left. The central portrait\'s monochrome palette blends beautifully with the background. My attention is drawn to the effective use of typography.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built and verified the single-file company profile landing page for **REKAVANTA \342\200\224 Technology & Product Studio** in `/index.html`.\n\n### Summary of Implementation & Verification\n\n- **Section 01 \342\200\224 Hero / Company Introduction (`#home`)**:\n  - Built on the `#DADADA` / `#CDCDCD` / `#111111` monochromatic palette with a `u = min(100vw / 1440, 1.333px)` proportional scale and `938u` target desktop height.\n  - Features the upper-left sliding active-pill navigation (`Home`, `Studio`, `Work`), upper-right `Contact \342\206\227` trigger, clipped mask-reveal `Archivo` headline (`\"BUILD WHAT\'S NEXT.\"`), supporting copy, and the two business cards (`02+ Business Directions` and `03 Selected Initiatives`).\n  - Integrates an original monochromatic editorial portrait of a technology architect seen from behind with the embedded `REKAVANTA` / `TECHNOLOGY & PRODUCT STUDIO` brand identity plate, the right-hand `(ABOUT REKAVANTA)` column with `Explore Our Studio \342\206\227` and `Start a Conversation \342\206\227` CTAs, and the bottom conceptual domain bar (`SOFTWARE`, `PRODUCTS`, `INTELLIGENCE`).\n- **Section 02 \342\200\224 Manifesto / Company Philosophy (`#manifesto`)**:\n  - Full-width `#000000` canvas featuring the 24-word brand statement distributed across five centered lines, with each word wrapped in its own `.manifesto-word` span.\n  - Implements a scroll-driven reading-order color reveal from `#6F6F6F` to `#F4F4F4` with a 3-word soft transition edge (plus `?rec=1` time-based progression support), accompanied by the supporting statement and the `ENGINEERING`, `INNOVATION`, and `IMPACT` labels.\n- **Section 03 \342\200\224 Our Studio / Business Model & Selected Work (`#studio` & `#work`)**:\n  - Bordered editorial panel (`rgba(255,255,255,0.14)`) presenting `\"Two engines. One direction.\"` and the two distinct pillars (`PILLAR 01 \342\200\224 DIGITAL SERVICES` and `PILLAR 02 \342\200\224 DIGITAL PRODUCTS`).\n  - Showcases the three Selected Initiatives (`01 \342\200\224 HUNI` [PRODUCT CONCEPT], `02 \342\200\224 PERSONAL OS` [PRODUCT CONCEPT], and `03 \342\200\224 SENTUL TREKKING INFORMATION SYSTEM` [COMMUNITY PROJECT]) with category filters and interactive initiative brief modals, followed by the final call to action (`\"Have an idea worth building?\"` / `\"Let\'s Build Together \342\206\227\"`), a validated inquiry dialog, and a minimal footer.\n- **Verification**:\n  - **Unit Tests**: Verified word-by-word scroll interpolation math (soft 3-word transition edge) and inquiry form validation via `node:test`.\n  - **Browser & Responsive Checks**: Verified across `1440x900` desktop and `390x844` mobile viewports with zero console errors and zero horizontal overflow (`scrollWidth === innerWidth`)."
