  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Visuals Meticulously**\n\nI\'m currently captivated by the imagery, especially `f1-desktop-hero.png`, `f1-desktop-manifesto.png`, and `f1-desktop-studio.png`. The visual impact is noteworthy! I\'m now zeroing in on `f1-desktop-hero.png` and `f1-mobile.png`, to address two subtle clipping issues.\n\n\n**Adjusting Placement Precisely**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed the clipping culprit in `f1-desktop-hero.png`. The placement of `.hero-brand-plate` and `.hero-jacket-wordmarks` within `.hero-photo-wrap` caused an undesired shift. I plan to rectify this by making them direct children of `.hero-artboard`, allowing for accurate positioning and preventing any unwanted clipping, ensuring the visual elements align perfectly.\n\n\n"
